# spotify: green disc, three thin symmetric sound arcs. Lit from above:
# outline one step darker on the upper half, two steps darker on the lower
# half, one shade row at the bottom.
#
# The 25d366 highlight along the top was drawn by Nikola and crosses ramps on purpose.
# 63c74d is already the lightest step of the Endesga green, so there is no lighter step
# to shade with, and the emerald ramp added for whatsapp supplies one. That does mean
# 25d366 now appears in spotify, whatsapp and one slack arm.
#
# The bottom arc used to sit one pixel right of centre, left over from the
# edge-to-edge pass that widened the disc and dragged the arcs along with it.
# All three arcs are now centred on the same axis as the disc. Nikola chose this
# minimal fix over narrowing the arcs back to their pre-edge-to-edge widths and
# over restoring the smaller disc wholesale.
A 3e8948
B 25d366
C 63c74d
D 181425
E 265c42
